        title: "De Mairan's Nebula",
        author: 'JDavis',
        lastUpdated: '2009-05-08 06:48:35',
        categories: ['Places'],
        images: undefined,
        rawContent: "{{Stellar Navigation Information|\r\n|name =De Mairan's Nebula\r\n|type =Nebula\r\n|part_of =the [[De Mairan Sector]]\r\n}}\r\n\r\n'''De Mairan's Well''' is a nebula in the [[De Mairan Sector]], and is a source of antimatter. It is a significant landmark, and is used as a navigation point and the source of the Sector's name.\r\n\r\n[[Category:Places]]"
