        rawContent: "'''Njiorin's Well''' is a nebula in the [[Njiorin Sector]], and is rich in antimatter. It is so important to the sector that the entire sector was renamed after it in the [[24th Century]].\r\n\r\nThe nebula was first discovered by [[Njiorin Osrason]] in the [[22nd Century]].\r\n\r\n[[Category:Places]]"
