        images: undefined,
        rawContent: "'''Caelire''' is a [[Meroniri]] world, and the traditional territory of the Arufins. It is located in the [[Yanen System]].\r\n\r\nThe capital city is [[Dianar Tulava]].\r\n\r\n[[Category:Planets]]"
