        rawContent: "{{Planet Information|\r\n|name =Caledon\r\n|image =\r\n|caption =\r\n|star_system =[[Cinaed System]]\r\n|population =4 Billion\r\n|sovereign =<small>[[Image:UnitedMesarthrimClansFlag.png|20px]] [[United Mesarthrim Clans]] [[2320]]-[[2325]]<br/>[[Image:AuellalFlag.png|20px]] [[Auellal League]] [[2325]]-[[2334]]<br/>[[Image:MesarthrimFederationFlag.png|20px]] [[Mesarthrim Federation]] [[2334]]-onwards</small>\r\n|capital =[[The Ollivian Caisteal]]\r\n|orbit =\r\n|rotation =\r\n|satellite =\r\n|satellite_orbit =\r\n}}\r\n'''Caledon''' is the 6th planet in the [[Cinaed System]].\r\n\r\n==History==\r\n\r\n-incomplete-\r\n\r\n==Geography==\r\n\r\n-incomplete-\r\n\r\n==Surface Conditions==\r\n\r\n-incomplete-\r\n\r\n===Hazards===\r\n\r\n-incomplete-\r\n\r\n==Orbit and Rotation==\r\n\r\nIt takes Caledon XX hours, XX minutes and XX seconds to rotate around its axis. From Caledon, the apparent motion of celestial bodies in the sky is to the XX. Caledon orbits Cinaed every XXX.XXX days. XX orbits around Caledon every X.X days.\r\n\r\n==Moons==\r\n\r\n-incomplete-\r\n\r\n[[Category:Planets]]"
