        rawContent: "{{Planet Information|\r\n|name =Comur\r\n|image =\r\n|caption =\r\n|star_system =[[Tirshan System]]\r\n|population =\r\n|sovereign =<small>[[Image:UnitedMesarthrimClansFlag.png|20px]] [[United Mesarthrim Clans]] [[2300]]-[[2325]]<br/>[[Image:UnitedCentusiStatesFlag.png|20px]] [[United Centusi States]] [[2325]]-[[2333]]<br/>[[Image:ComurResistanceFlag.png|20px]] [[Comur Resistance]] [[2333]]-[[2334]]<br/>[[Image:MesarthrimFederationFlag.png|20px]] [[Mesarthrim Federation]] [[2334]]-onwards</small>\r\n|capital =[[Tincomalee]]\r\n|orbit =\r\n|rotation =\r\n|satellite =\r\n|satellite_orbit =\r\n}}\r\n'''Comur''' is the XXth planet in the [[Tirshan System]].\r\n\r\n==History==\r\n\r\n-incomplete-\r\n\r\n==Geography==\r\n\r\nCapital city: [[Tincomalee]]\r\n\r\nComur has xx continents, covering a wide range of biospheres and climates.\r\n\r\n==Surface Conditions==\r\n\r\n-incomplete-\r\n\r\n===Hazards===\r\n\r\n-incomplete-\r\n\r\n==Orbit and Rotation==\r\n\r\nIt takes Comur XX hours, XX minutes and XX seconds to rotate around its axis. From Comur, the apparent motion of celestial bodies in the sky is to the XX. Comur orbits Tirshan every XXX.XXX days. XX orbits around Comur every X.X days.\r\n\r\n==Moons==\r\n\r\n-incomplete-\r\n\r\n[[Category:Planets]]"
