        images: undefined,
        rawContent: "'''Kronheim''' is the XXth planet in the [[Yngard System]].\r\n\r\n==History==\r\n\r\nKronheim is the homeworld of the [[Ikronin Jurekön]]. It's a nearly frozen world, locked in an ice age known as the \"Long Winter\". Recently, it has begun to thaw.\r\n\r\n==Geography==\r\n\r\nKronheim has XX continents.\r\n\r\n==Orbit and Rotation==\r\n\r\nIt takes Kronheim XX hours, XX minutes and XX seconds to rotate around its axis. From Kronheim, the apparent motion of celestial bodies in the sky is to the XX. Kronheim orbits Yngard every XXX.XXX days. XX orbits around Kronheim every X.X days.\r\n\r\n[[Category:Planets]]"
